From-scratch pure Go QR Code Model 2 implementation based on the user-owned
SpecQR algorithm and API contracts. No external Go modules, CGO, native QR
bindings, wrappers around other language editions or copied third-party QR
source are used. Runtime has no network or resource-download requirement.

Behavioral baseline: SpecQR/SpecQR JavaScript
15ad15e5c770ea0e39072f8f88b2733018f02ffd (3.0.0-rc.2).
